Bind Npc 14427 Zone 2
Quest 412 "[Repeatable Solo] Death Knight Hunt"
    Repeat always
    Journal "[Guard] Zalk has commissioned you to hunt Death Knight. However, it will not count when you are in a party."
    Kill 20 of 1104, 1154 at direction_106

Requires player level >= 40 and player is elmorad

Rewards
    Give 1000000 experience or 1400000 with premium

direction_106 = location "Death Knight" about "Death Knight\nAn undead like the undying, possesses great strength as it is composed of powerful bone structure" found "El Morad" elmorad at 997 1024 in zone 2

On available
    Say "Master, Zalk is looking for you. I wonder when these missions would end..."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Show quest "This is the your mission. You've been an enormous help. The prey is Death Knights, skeletons known for their power."

On in_progress
    Say "Please do your best till the end!"
    Topic "Where can I find it?" do
        Map direction_106

On claimable
    Show quest "Thank you. I will remember your name!"
